        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Raise Blackfrost"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(cold, conjuration, occult)\n\nThe blackfrost prophet selects a point within 60 feet, then calls upon shards of blackfrost to stab up through the crust in a 30-foot burst. Creatures in the area take 2d8 piercing damage plus 2d8 cold damage (DC 28 basic Reflex save). A creature that takes cold damage from this ability is exposed to blackfrost. Until the next time the blackfrost prophet uses Raise Blackfrost, the affected area is difficult terrain."
            },
